    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n47856" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">θάμνος</span></b> , ὁ, also ἡ
		<i><span class="en">
			D.S.
			2.49
		</span></i>: (cf. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">θαμέες</span>):—<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>bush, shrub</i>, 
